"entity": {
"name": "Lloyds Metals & Energy Limited",
"description": "Lloyds Metals & Energy Ltd. engages in the manufacturing, generation, and distribution of iron, steel, and power. It operates through the following segments: Mining and Value Added Products. The Mining segment includes includes production and manufacturing of iron ore. The Value Added Products segment focuses on manufacturing of sponge iron, production of pellet and generation of power. The company was founded by Babulal Kesardeo Agarwal and Rajesh Rajnarayan Gupta on April 5, 1977 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.",
